{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"5047fe939208dc9d7d7800512fdc8785df437c923edae58be85d774edf8d0b1d","ja":"これまでも、これからも","zh":"无论是过去，还是将来","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"28aa5106b908a5b6a13fa95cd6fbf6a9e529e04e33452d7404074c21e5368e95","ja":"もう終わりか～！\n時間ギリギリまで踊っちゃったよ～♪","zh":"已经结束了吗～！\n一直跳到了最后一刻呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"e5a574b554ad2d8cc6df1237193b39cf645962ce3122a9460a50a5852a5af8ba","ja":"あたしも名残惜しかったよ。\nこのまま時間が止まってほしいくらいだったな！","zh":"我也很舍不得呢。\n甚至希望时间能就这样停下来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8b7d319fc0b22916d02b016316a51afe4034a61a15200c05a5ee0328da2b69bb","ja":"うん、本当楽しかった……\nあ、SNSにも感想あがってる！","zh":"嗯，真的很开心……\n啊，社交平台上也有人发感想了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"cb6c4f6c11089039e30466ea07aa352cc044cdbc44c8e932a70712bf31dca778","ja":"ウチらのファンも、初めてパフォーマンスを\n見てくれた観客も、喜んでくれたみたいだな。","zh":"我们的粉丝，还有第一次看我们演出的\n观众，看来都很高兴呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"429d9220bc51f37b8e3387d5359a218eb0c916c6f14509a4da2b3174e9cf906e","ja":"うん。少しずつ人が集まってきて、\r\nいっぱいになっていくの、すっごくドキドキしたよ！","zh":"嗯。看着人一点点聚过来，\n变得越来越满，真的超级让人心跳加速呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e77132279b3db582cf049ac4ed9a9497f98b86f0a626964914bfc275f4632919","ja":"歩のダンス、\n宣言通り、すごかったな。","zh":"步的舞蹈，\n正如她所说的，真厉害啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"74100cbcada06befc047d766dc5e22b2106f36257e48d9c7e5314f4856e511b6","ja":"いつも以上に、パワフルでダイナミックで……\nみんなの目をくぎ付けにしてたぜ。","zh":"比平时更加充满力量、更具气魄……\n牢牢抓住了大家的目光呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"92a8809f72cba01871351f13162209aba0bde366e61faad75cfff59e337cbca8","ja":"ジュリアこそ！　あのじっくり聞かせる感じ……\nストリートの雰囲気と、ばっちり合ってたよ！","zh":"茱莉亚才是呢！那种让人静下心来细细聆听的感觉……\n和街头的氛围非常相配哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f1e966cd71e8130cdd7a996e674f0e895a891ca99addfae9040fcd6a8a953766","ja":"いつものライブとはいろいろ違ったけど、\nすごく楽しかったな！","zh":"虽然和以往的演出有诸多不同，\n但真的非常开心呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"ca04ba9c2fd830dab3bb3f6372363b992fe46fb853d53d3fcb3816c4528a209a","ja":"今は前よりずっとたくさん、応援してくれる人がいる。\nでも、ワクワク感や一体感は、変わらないのかもな。","zh":"现在支持自己的人比以前多得多了。\n不过，那种兴奋感与一体感，或许并没有改变吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"0109679fad6d861bd715e21b652731744eee93a9ce0920187b008b487608d147","ja":"うん……この気持ち、忘れたくないよね！\n過去も今も……それに未来も！　全部、大事だと思う！","zh":"嗯……这份心情，真不想忘记呢！\n无论是过去还是现在……还有未来也是！我觉得全部都很重要！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7b9813e4cf32faf80da5ed8717735ca7083cb664c7d5d27e06853759d785e385","ja":"ああ。またゲリラライブにも挑戦したいよな。\n今度は夜の街中とかいいかも。","zh":"嗯。之后也想再去挑战街头突击Live啊。\n下次选在夜晚的街头或许也不错。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1740.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"122f8bd92f7c42eedb57f7c4a2d5194e22a2765a90205c1f344030daa5f2d8fc","ja":"あはは、それ面白そう！\n今度、●●●●プロデューサーに話してみよっか♪","zh":"啊哈哈，那好像很有意思！\n下次和●●●●制作人说一声看看吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
